        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Gold plating applies a thin gold layer over a compatible base metal such as sterling silver or brass. For custom silver jewelry, plating color and finish can be developed around the target appearance, expected wear and price positioning.</p><p><strong>Process:</strong> Electroplating a gold layer over the prepared metal surface.<br><strong>Gold Thickness:</strong> Specified according to project requirements.<br><strong>Durability:</strong> Influenced by plating thickness, protective finish and wear conditions.</p>",
