        "body": "<p>Lost wax casting transforms a refined wax model into finished metal jewelry. After the design is confirmed, wax models are assembled, invested in a ceramic shell and heated so the wax can be removed. Molten silver is then poured into the mold to reproduce the approved form.</p><p>This process supports both detailed custom silver jewelry and repeatable production while preserving the proportions and construction established during development.</p>",
